        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Badita sanaamu aba Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba lah bea sheedeaba lah, bea eaweedeaba muut bea sheeda, nea abeeda geandi gheenyu sea gweargwa Yuda. Hean ghaanyaschi uurda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA aba geeshangiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghaang'weardi ghaadaayi gisiihiimu uurji siida. Ghang'eada ng'eanyi ea gagul mananda gawuurji beasta, ak ghang'eada mananda ea gawa heetiyeada ghameang'meang' ea gawuurji gharinyeanda oomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoahaakta geadi giduurji geatinda ak ghoang'waay buudeageasu. Ak goodiing'danean guroorooda ASEETA bugusta ng'eanyiida ea humng'eeda, ak ghwaadan ea ghoahiitanaan Yerusalemu, nea geandi jeeda gili siihiimu bea ASEETEAN. Ak ghaahiti heeda gidaghuuta doodooda bea jih mida meatkweeda wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa, was heeda siyiin sanaamooda was sicheeda aba heeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda giigheambiita ASEETA fuga Israeli gwanda hoowa nea gawuurji giigheambiitida ghayi aadaayi aba mooheedean aba jeeda gida siihiimnaaniin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeeshiinean ASEETA, “Ea orjeeda siida, ang'wearda heabi ak ging'ulayi wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa ak ging'ulayi wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa bea gidaghuuta.” Abeeda hooweani siskean gwanda sanaamooda sit ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeeshiinean ASEETA, “Ea orjeeda siida, gidaahi ng'asheega sin, ng'asheega hees munyas sin fuga Israeli aba hiji, gagasa ghahoanan goosheagiideawanean heedeanyu ghaydidi? Ak gaydaaha ng'asheega hees munyas suuk.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweanean ea ghwayiinaan gidaghuuta doodooda; ama aang'weardi ghaadaay seawadeeda mida ghamarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeeshiinean, “Ea orjeeda siida, asi saawa ghamari.” Hean nea ghaasaawji ghaadaayi gwanda gidaghuuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeeshiinean, “Una jeeda ak gidaahi ng'asheega munyas sin aba hiji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geawi jeeda ak ghaadaayi sanaamajeega diyeanga manang'i ea heeluutka diyeanga ea gea munyas, ea sanaamajeega sean bea fuga Israeli nea sing'waar eeneaweesa ghamarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda madeedeaba sanaamajeesu ghamiinaada gweargwa Israeli was laadam ea damanamughuush sea Yasaniya was orjeeda Shafani. Ak gaba nih mideawa gisigwarriideawa hideeda ng'andidi aba geatindaanyi, ak gwadiyeada humng'eeda aroosta leabu jeeda hideeda ng'andidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeeshiinean ASEETA, “Ea orjeeda siida, gidaahi gidasin gweargwa Israeli aba jeeda misaneeda. Gaba nih mida jeeda ghooriidaanyi bea sanaamu, aba gideaba geeyi, ‘NG'UTAMIIDA mwadaaheasa, NG'UTAMIIDA ninung'waada ng'eanyiini.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gabiikta gwayeeshiinean ASEETA, “Gaydaaha gicha ng'asheega munyas hees suuk sin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweanean ea ghwayiinaan dooshta weah jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, mida meatkweeda wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa, aang'weardi ghaadaayi gadeemga abiitpiit nea gooyeawda aba badayda Damusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeeshiinean ASEETA, “Ea orjeeda siida, nidaahi ng'asheesu? Gaydaaha gicha ng'asheega munyas hees naawa suh.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaadan ea ghoahiitanaan doodooda mida jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. Nea aba hoowa bea gidaghuuta gheeda sibata ASEETEAN abeeda bugusta doodooda ea heeda wagiida gwanda headi diktam ea muut, nea geefuursa bwadaw gheeda sibata ASEETA, nea gheamamuunatka nyaawa geefuursa wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa. Nea abeeda geabwat aseeta arearu, nea geefuursa geat wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeeshiinean ASEETA, “Ea orjeeda siida, heapi nidaahi ng'asheesu? Geabwada nih fuga Yuda ghwadaah gideaba ng'asheesu munyasiin gideaba ea manang'i ghwanung' ghwanyiit ng'eanyiida ng'asheega munyas, nea ghoanyareasan muuchi. Ng'ula, gidabitbita aba hoowa ghoanyareasan ea gabun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba badaydeaba ng'asheesu gayghwadaah giteena nyarasteanyu, maydasiksa eara akaleala ghabwasang'da nea maydabwayda eara sih. Eara gooyeawda aba ghuuta haw maydealeeysiit saawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
